- [S1] STC8 failed: Each action node must have exactly one incoming and one outgoing edge. | Node `n16` has in=1 and out=0. | Node `n9` has in=1 and out=0. | DSL: action(n16,"Receive Invoice"); action(n9,"Rework PO")
- [S2] STC9 failed: Each branch node must have exactly one incoming and at least two outgoing edges. | Node `b3` has in=1 and out=1. | Node `b4` has in=1 and out=1. | Node `b5` has in=1 and out=1. | DSL: branch(b3,XOR); branch(b4,XOR); branch(b5,XOR)
- [S3] STC11 failed: Each variable definition must have a valid range with at least two distinct values. | Variable `v3` has an invalid range `['Packing Slip Received']`. | Variable `v4` has an invalid range `['Inventory Received']`. | Variable `v5` has an invalid range `['Successful Match']`.
- [S4] STC15 failed: Every variable used in a guard must be formally defined. | Guard `v3 = 'Packing Slip Received'` on `b3 -> n14` uses undefined variable `v3`. | Guard `v4 = 'Inventory Received'` on `b4 -> n15` uses undefined variable `v4`. | Guard `v5 = 'Successful Match'` on `b5 -> n18` uses undefined variable `v5`. | DSL: guard(b3,n14,"v3 = 'Packing Slip Received'"); guard(b4,n15,"v4 = 'Inventory Received'"); guard(b5,n18,"v5 = 'Successful Match'")
- [S5] STC20 failed: Every non-end node must have a path to at least one end node. | Violations: b3, n10, n12, n14, n16, n9 | DSL: branch(b3,XOR); action(n10,"Reserve Funds for Released POs"); action(n12,"Receive Packing Slip"); action(n14,"Proceed to Receive Invoice"); action(n16,"Receive Invoice"); action(n9,"Rework PO")

